  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>迷你 </strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">跑酷</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">天堂</span></strong></h1>\n<p>這款跑酷地圖是大型「跑酷天堂」地圖的精簡版。僅有 9 個房間，最後還有一段終界維度的跑酷關卡。難度適中，不難也不易，適合所有玩家挑戰。要完成此地圖，你需要在最後一間房跳入終界傳送門。在終界維度中，有一段很長且沒有任何檢查點的跑酷路線，挑戰性會稍高一些。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>盡情跳躍吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p>宣傳影片：</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pxs5HKz03kQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">我的其他地圖：</span></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/skyblock-on-mobs-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物頭上的空島</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1059850/description_8e6f21d3-626d-4bcd-89ce-4ce401abfa08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/mini-parkour-paradise-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>迷你跑酷天堂</strong><strong> 2</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1059850/description_b11db5da-c5b2-49de-bc01-b63ac9ab8ca5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"432\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道！ <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/@Elwizz7\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.youtube.com/@Elwizz7</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
